  "citation": "Novelli P C; Masarie K A (1998): Measurement of Air Pollution from Satellites (MAPS) 1994 Correlative Atmospheric Carbon Monoxide Mixing Ratios. CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/ATG.DB1020",
